<title>USA: Liberty clarifies Tele-Comms relationship.</title>
<headline>Liberty clarifies Tele-Comms relationship.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty Media Group said on Friday that its president and chief executive officer, Peter Barton, will continue to report directly to the TCI board and its chairman John Malone.</p>
<p>In an earlier statement announcing that Leo Hindery will become TCI's new president, TCI said that the CEOs of communications, programming, international and technology will report to Hindery.</p>
<p>But Barton, who represents the programming side, will continue to report to Malone, Liberty said.</p>
</text>
